<?xml version="1.0"?>
<rdf:RDF xmlns="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/aquaticresourceobservation.owl#"
     xml:base="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/aquaticresourceobservation.owl"
     xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#"
     xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
     xmlns:xml="http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace"
     xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#"
     xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
     xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"
     xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/"
     xmlns:owl2xml="http://www.w3.org/2006/12/owl2-xml#"
     xmlns:observation="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/observation.owl#"
     xmlns:water_FAO_areas="http://www.fao.org/aims/aos/fi/water_FAO_areas.owl#"
     xmlns:species_taxonomic="http://www.fao.org/aims/aos/fi/species_taxonomic.owl#"
     xmlns:cpannotationschema="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/schemas/cpannotationschema.owl#"
     xmlns:aquaticresourceobservation="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/aquaticresourceobservation.owl#">
    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/aquaticresourceobservation.owl">
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/observation.owl"/>
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/speciesfactsheets.owl"/>
        <owl:imports rdf:resource="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/waterareasfactsheets.owl"/>
        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">To represent the aquatic observation data extracted from factsheet application. An aquatic observation refers to a specific year, is about an aquatic resource, and is situated in a given habitat, in which the aquatic species from the resource live. Observations can have a reporting year that is different from the observation time.</dcterms:description>
        <dcterms:title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Aquaticresourceobservation Pattern</dcterms:title>
        <cpannotationschema:coversRequirements>For an aquatic resource, what species, in what fishing areas, climatic zones, bottom types, depth zones, geo forms, horizontal and vertical distribution, and for what standardized abundance level, exploitation state and rate, have been observed? for what reference year? At what year the observation has been recorded?</cpannotationschema:coversRequirements>
        <cpannotationschema:hasAuthor>Aldo Gangemi (CNR), based on specifications by Claudio Baldassarre (UN-FAO), Caterina Caracciolo (UN-FAO), and Michael Erdmann (Ontoprise), for the NeOn project.</cpannotationschema:hasAuthor>
        <cpannotationschema:hasComponent>http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/speciesfactsheets.owl</cpannotationschema:hasComponent>
        <cpannotationschema:hasComponent>http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/waterareasfactsheets.owl</cpannotationschema:hasComponent>
        <cpannotationschema:hasConsequences>We are able to query and reason on the data extracted from the FactSheets XML database, concerning the observation of aquatic resources. There are more data in that database, however.</cpannotationschema:hasConsequences>
        <cpannotationschema:hasIntent rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">To represent the aquatic observation data extracted from factsheet application. An aquatic observation refers to a specific year, is about an aquatic resource, and is situated in a given habitat, in which the aquatic species from the resource live. Observations can have a reporting year that is different from the observation time.</cpannotationschema:hasIntent>
        <cpannotationschema:hasUnitTest>SELECT ?x
WHERE {
?x isObservationOf ?ar .
?x forReferenceYear ?y1 .
?x hasReportingYear ?y2 }</cpannotationschema:hasUnitTest>
        <cpannotationschema:isSpecializationOf>http://ontologydesignpattern.org/cp/owl/observation.owl</cpannotationschema:isSpecializationOf>
        <cpannotationschema:relatedCPs>http://ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/catchrecord.owl</cpannotationschema:relatedCPs>
        <cpannotationschema:scenarios>The aquatic resource for Skipjack tuna in Northern Atlantic in 2004 (as reported in 2008) was observed with low abundance level.</cpannotationschema:scenarios>
        <rdfs:comment>An ontology that represents the semantics of a database view about &quot;observations&quot; for an aquatic resource, aggregated once a year.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK&apos;s quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label added x20; term declared x3;
- label corrected: &lt;http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/aquaticresourceobservation.owl#DepletedExploitationState&gt; &quot;Depleted&quot; is now &quot;Depleted (exploitation state)&quot; - a value of several code lists with one label (duplicate_label); the code list it belongs to, from its name, added in brackets
- label corrected: &lt;http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/aquaticresourceobservation.owl#DepletedStdAbundanceLevel&gt; &quot;Depleted&quot; is now &quot;Depleted (abundance level)&quot; - a value of several code lists with one label (duplicate_label); the code list it belongs to, from its name, added in brackets
- label corrected: &lt;http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/aquaticresourceobservation.owl#NotProvidedExploitationRate&gt; &quot;Not Provided&quot; is now &quot;Not Provided (exploitation rate)&quot; - a value of several code lists with one label (duplicate_label); the code list it belongs to, from its name, added in brackets
- label corrected: &lt;http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/aquaticresourceobservation.owl#NotProvidedExploitationState&gt; &quot;Not Provided&quot; is now &quot;Not Provided (exploitation state)&quot; - a value of several code lists with one label (duplicate_label); the code list it belongs to, from its name, added in brackets
- label corrected: &lt;http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/aquaticresourceobservation.owl#NotProvidedStdAbundanceLevel&gt; &quot;Not Provided&quot; is now &quot;Not Provided (abundance level)&quot; - a value of several code lists with one label (duplicate_label); the code list it belongs to, from its name, added in brackets
- label corrected: &lt;http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/aquaticresourceobservation.owl#UncertainOrNotAssessedExploitationRate&gt; &quot;Uncertain/Not Assessed&quot; is now &quot;Uncertain/Not Assessed (exploitation rate)&quot; - a value of several code lists with one label (duplicate_label); the code list it belongs to, from its name, added in brackets
- label corrected: &lt;http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/aquaticresourceobservation.owl#UncertainOrNotAssessedStdAbundanceLevel&gt; &quot;Uncertain/Not Assessed&quot; is now &quot;Uncertain/Not Assessed (abundance level)&quot; - a value of several code lists with one label (duplicate_label); the code list it belongs to, from its name, added in brackets
- label corrected: &lt;http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/aquaticresourceobservation.owl#UnspecifiedClimaticZone&gt; &quot;Unspecified&quot; is now &quot;Unspecified (climatic zone)&quot; - a value of several code lists with one label (duplicate_label); the code list it belongs to, from its name, added in brackets (the source types it BottomType; its name says climatic zone)
- label corrected: &lt;http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/aquaticresourceobservation.owl#UnspecifiedDepthZone&gt; &quot;Unspecified&quot; is now &quot;Unspecified (depth zone)&quot; - a value of several code lists with one label (duplicate_label); the code list it belongs to, from its name, added in brackets
- label corrected: &lt;http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/aquaticresourceobservation.owl#UnspecifiedGeoforms&gt; &quot;Unspecified&quot; is now &quot;Unspecified (geoform)&quot; - a value of several code lists with one label (duplicate_label); the code list it belongs to, from its name, added in brackets
- label corrected: &lt;http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/aquaticresourceobservation.owl#UnspecifiedHorizontalDistribution&gt; &quot;Unspecified&quot; is now &quot;Unspecified (horizontal distribution)&quot; - a value of several code lists with one label (duplicate_label); the code list it belongs to, from its name, added in brackets
- label corrected: &lt;http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/fsdas/aquaticresourceobservation.owl#UnspecifiedVerticalDistribution&gt; &quot;Unspecified&quot; is now &quot;Unspecified (vertical distribution)&quot; - a value of several code lists with one label (duplicate_label); the code list it belongs to, from its name, added in brackets
- header: dcterms:title &quot;Aquaticresourceobservation Pattern&quot; - the library&apos;s name for the pattern
- header: dcterms:description - the library&apos;s description of the pattern
